    stem: "(m) Wave energy technology captures the energy of water waves to do useful work such as generating electricity. Give two possible disadvantages associated with wave energy technology as an energy source.",
    questionText: "Explain the term material creep in relation to jet-engine components.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"fixed"}, totalMarks: 5,
